WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Today is the day! You've done the hard part. A few final reminders before you

2
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:04.320
head in.

3
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.800
Stop all clear liquids at least four and a half hours before your arrival time.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.930
Nothing to drink after that point, including water. Continue to avoid solid

5
00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.000
foods and alcohol.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.810
Avoid hard candy, gum, and mints. These count as food and can affect your

7
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.160
sedation. Take a moment

8
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.290
to confirm that your output has been running clear. That's the sign that your

9
00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.040
prep has done

10
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.060
its job. If you're not there yet, please contact your doctor's office before

11
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:29.840
coming in.

12
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:35.200
Lastly, your driver should also be ready to go. Your doctor is looking forward

13
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:35.760
to seeing you

14
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.360
and taking great care of you today.
